(340,66,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"da3d0bf\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0dd2a3c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Franco\'s Landscaping: Crafting Your Dream Outdoors with Passion and Precision!\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"34\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_background_color_stop_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_color_stop_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_color_b_stop_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_color_b_stop_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_gradient_angle_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_gradient_angle_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_color_stop_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_color_stop_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_color_b_stop_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_color_b_stop_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_gradient_angle_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_background_hover_gradient_angle_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"566a943\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c9d2ab4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"cd0c75e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Untitled-design-1.png\",\"id\":1116,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ea96a78\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b2f4888\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, our deep-rooted commitment to excellence and an unwavering passion for transforming outdoor areas into awe-inspiring landscapes and resilient constructions are what set us apart. Nestled in the vibrant community of Lynn, MA, and extending our services across the whole of Essex County, our family-run business has been a beacon of innovation and quality in landscaping and construction services for well over a decade. We are more than just a company; we are a team of skilled professionals, artisans, and visionaries dedicated to delivering not just results, but creating an unparalleled customer experience that resonates long after our work is done.<\\/p><p>Our guiding philosophy is deeply entwined with the personal journeys of our clients. We understand that each client comes with a unique vision, a dream of transforming their outdoor space into something more than just an area. It is this understanding that propels us to meticulously plan and execute every project with the utmost precision, ensuring that the final outcome not only meets but exceeds our clients\' expectations. From the meticulous planning stages to the execution and final touches, our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty is evident in every stone laid and every plant positioned.<\\/p><p>Sustainability is at the heart of our operations. In an era where environmental concerns are paramount, we stand committed to practices that are not just good for business, but beneficial for our planet. We choose eco-friendly materials and employ techniques that minimize environmental impact, thereby enhancing the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space. This commitment to sustainability extends beyond the materials we use; it is woven into the very fabric of our design philosophy, ensuring that your outdoor space is not only beautiful but also harmonious with nature.<\\/p><p>The range of services we offer is as diverse as the landscapes we have the privilege of transforming. Whether you dream of a serene garden retreat, a lively outdoor living area perfect for family gatherings, a sophisticated walkway lined with elegant pavers, or a robust construction project that stands the test of time, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your ultimate partner. We thrive on challenges, transforming complex visions into tangible realities, and crafting spaces that inspire joy, tranquility, and beauty.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Public Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"eada0b4\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0258209\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#1D741B\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"55c9ead\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f901b48\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Ready to transform your outdoor space with Franco\'s Landscaping & Construction? \",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typogra