r experience.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Our philosophy centers on understanding our clients\' visions and turning them into reality. From the initial design to the final touches, we ensure every project reflects our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty. We believe in sustainable practices, using eco-friendly materials and techniques that not only benefit the environment but also enhance the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #000000;\\\">Whether you\'re looking to create a serene outdoor retreat, enhance the curb appeal of your property, or undertake a significant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Georgia\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"7db52e2c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"19a67fbb\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"animation\":\"zoomInDown\",\"animation_duration\":\"slow\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6b069975\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Our Recent Projects\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Georgia\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"bold\",\"typography_text_transform\":\"uppercase\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bot