(2436,954,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"af6b5ce\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e512b70\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Our Recent Projects\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Georgia\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"800\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"_flex_size\":\"grow\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fdea887\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f4bfd66\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#1D741B\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"88eaeff\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\"><strong>Landscaping Services:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h2><p><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">Our landscaping services are where creativity meets nature, resulting in breathtaking outdoor spaces that reflect our clients\' dreams. Recent landscaping projects highlight our ability to transform ordinary yards into stunning gardens and living spaces. Whether it\'s a vibrant floral arrangement that captivates the senses or a harmonious water feature that brings tranquility to your garden, Francos Landscaping &amp; Construction is dedicated to creating spaces where life flourishes. Our expertise extends to designing functional and beautiful hardscapes, such as patios and walkways, that complement your home\'s architecture and enhance your outdoor experience. Each project is a collaborative journey with our clients, ensuring that the final landscape is not just beautiful but also a true reflection of their vision and lifestyle.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Georgia\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2d5360e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#1D741B\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"add1ced\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\"><strong>Construction Services:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h2><p><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we take pride in transforming concepts into concrete reality. Our recent construction projects are a testament to our team\'s expertise and commitment to excellence. From custom-designed decks that provide a serene outdoor retreat to elegant pergolas that enhance backyard aesthetics and functionality, each project is meticulously crafted to meet our clients\' unique needs. Our portfolio showcases diverse constructions, including robust retaining walls that blend seamlessly with the natural landscape and luxurious outdoor kitchens perfect for entertaining. Through precision, craftsmanship, and a keen eye for detail, we bring your vision to life, ensuring that every construction project not only meets but exceeds expectations.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Georgia\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"727881b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"03786b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#