g that the final landscape is not just beautiful but also a true reflection of their vision and lifestyle.<\\/span>\\n\\n<span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"align\":\"left\",\"text_color\":\"#000000\",\"_animation\":\"slideInLeft\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2d5360e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#1D741B\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"add1ced\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\"><strong>Construction Services:<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h2>\\n<span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\"><br>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we take pride in transforming concepts into concrete reality. Our recent construction projects are a testament to our team\'s expertise and commitment to excellence. From custom-designed decks that provide a serene outdoor retreat to elegant pergolas that enhance backyard aesthetics and functionality, each project is meticulously crafted to meet our clients\' unique needs. Our portfolio showcases diverse constructions, including robust retaining walls that blend seamlessly with the natural landscape and luxurious outdoor kitchens perfect for entertaining. Through precision, craftsmanship, and a keen eye for detail, we bring your vision to life, ensuring that every construction project not only meets but exceeds expectations.<\\/span>\\n\\n<span style=\\\"color: #ffffff;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/span>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_font_style\":\"italic\",\"align\":\"left\",\"text_color\":\"#000000\",\"_animation\":\"slideInLeft\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"5f23b0d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a82645\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Customer Reviews for Franco\'s Landscaping\\n\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#3A4042\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"d0244d4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"slides\":[{\"content\":\"Franco\'s Landscaping transformed our backyard into a paradise! Their construction services are top-notch, and their landscaping skills are truly exceptional. Highly recommend!\",\"name\":\"Sarah Thompson\",\"title\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Untitled-design-1-1.png\",\"id\":988,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"8c0cf0e\",\"selected_social_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"}},{\"content\":\"Franco\'s Landscaping did an amazing job with our front yard. Their attention to detail in both construction and landscaping services is impressive. Our house has never looked better.\",\"name\":\"Emily Davis\",\"title\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Untitled-design-1-1.png\",\"id\":988,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"fa94c94\",\"selected_social_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"}},{\"content\":\"Very pleased with Franco\'s Landscaping. The construction services were efficient and high quality. The landscaping brought our vision to life. Only minor delays, but worth the wait.\",\"name\":\"Michael Johnson\",\"title\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Untitled-design-1-1.png\",\"id\":988,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"fbb1f71\",\"selected_social_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"}},{\"content\":\"Franco\'s Landscaping exceeded our expectations. The team was friendly, and their expertise in both construction and landscaping services made our yard the envy of the neighborhood.\",\"name\":\"Jessica Lee\",\"title\":\"\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Untitled-design-1-1.png\",\"id\":988,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"selected_social_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"d6b367c\"}],\"slides_per_view\":\"2\",\"slides_to_scroll\":\"2\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"reviews\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"727881b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"03786b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#1D741B\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"dcb3151\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#98BC24\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"829d7b7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[foogallery id=\\\"865\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b43822b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c4ce48b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3cba04b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#1D741B\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"aa2fad5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"83ec7e3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"We invite you to take the first step towards transforming your outdoor spaces by reaching out to us today.\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"title_color\":\"#000000\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Public Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_flex_order\":\"end\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":34,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"50264c2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"flex_align_items\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b834280\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"facb981\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[contact-form-7 id=\\\"6\\\" title=\\\"Contact form 1\\\"]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b9ea64a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"04a8e96\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/07\\/Your-Dream-Outdoors-with-Passion-and-Precision.png\",\"id\":1106,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
