(698,1,'2024-03-21 19:01:36','2024-03-21 19:01:36','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-225x300.jpg 225w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />													\n		<h2><strong>About Franco\'s Landscaping<br /></strong></h2><p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we pride ourselves on our commitment to excellence and our passion for transforming outdoor spaces into breathtaking landscapes and robust constructions. Located in the heart of Lynn, MA, and serving the entirety of Essex County, our family-operated business has been setting the standard in landscaping and construction services for over a decade. Our team of skilled professionals is dedicated to delivering not just results but an unparalleled customer experience.</p><p>Our philosophy centers on understanding our clients\' visions and turning them into reality. From the initial design to the final touches, we ensure every project reflects our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty. We believe in sustainable practices, using eco-friendly materials and techniques that not only benefit the environment but also enhance the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space.</p><p>Whether you\'re looking to create a serene outdoor retreat, enhance the curb appeal of your property, or undertake a significant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-icon{font-size:var(--divider-icon-size)}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider-separator{display:flex;margin:0;direction:ltr}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:before{display:block;content:\"\";border-block-end:0;flex-grow:1;border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:first-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider-separator:before{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider__element{margin-left:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right .elementor-divider .element