ntor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:first-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider-separator:before{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-start:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:last-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider-separator:after{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-end:0}.elementor-widget-divider:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text):not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon) .elementor-divider-separator{border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern{--divider-border-style:none}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern.elementor-widget-divider--view-line .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not([class*=elementor-widget-divider--view]) .elementor-divider-separator{width:100%;min-height:var(--divider-pattern-height);-webkit-mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);background-color:var(--divider-color);-webkit-mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url);mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url)}.elementor-widget-divider--no-spacing{--divider-pattern-size:auto}.elementor-widget-divider--bg-round{--divider-pattern-repeat:round}.rtl .elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{direction:rtl}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-divider,.e-con>.elementor-widget-divider{width:var(--container-widget-width,100%);--flex-grow:var(--container-widget-flex-grow)}</style>		\n			<h2>Construction Services</h2>		\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3><a href=\"#\">Stone Walls</a></h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-225x300.jpg 225w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />													\n		<h2><strong>About Franco\'s Landscaping<br /></strong></h2><p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we pride ourselves on our commitment to excellence and our passion for transforming outdoor spaces into breathtaking landscapes and robust constructions. Located in the heart of Lynn, MA, and serving the entirety of Essex County, our family-operated business has been setting the standard in landscaping and construction services for over a decade. Our team of skilled professionals is dedicated to delivering not just results but an unparalleled customer experience.</p><p>Our philosophy centers on understanding our clients\' visions and turning them into reality. From the initial design to the final touches, we ensure every project reflects our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty. We believe in sustainable practices, using eco-friendly materials and techniques that not only benefit the environment but also enhance the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space.</p><p>Whether you\'re looking to create a serene outdoor retreat, enhance the curb appeal of your property, or undertake a significant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.</p>		\n			<h2>Our Recent Projects</h2>		\n			<h2>What We Providen</h2>		\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/css/widget-icon-box.min.css\">		\n				<a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M384 312.7c-55.1 136.7-187.1 54-187.1 54-40.5 81.8-107.4 134.4-184.6 134.7-16.1 0-16.6-24.4 0-24.4 64.4-.3 120.5-42.7 157.2-110.1-41.1 15.9-118.6 27.9-161.6-82.2 109-44.9 159.1 11.2 178.3 45.5 9.9-24.4 17-50.9 21.6-79.7 0 0-139.7 21.9-149.5-98.1 119.1-47.9 152.6 76.7 152.6 76.7 1.6-16.7 3.3-52.6 3.3-53.4 0 0-106.3-73.7-38.1-165.2 124.6 43 61.4 162.4 61.4 162.4.5 1.6.5 23.8 0 33.4 0 0 45.2-89 136.4-57.5-4.2 134-141.9 106.4-141.9 106.4-4.4 27.4-11.2 53.4-20 77.5 0 0 83-91.8 172-20z\"></path></svg>				</a>\n				<h3>\n					<a href=\"#\" >\n						Lawn Renovation					</a>\n				</h3>\n									<p>\n						Quisque commodo condimentum sollicitudin. Vestibulum nec posuere purus. Proin venenatis scelerisque dui sit amet placerat. 					</p>\n				<a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M378.31 378.49L298.42 288h30.63c9.01 0 16.98-5 20.78-13.06 3.8-8.04 2.55-17.26-3.28-24.05L268.42 160h28.89c9.1 0 17.3-5.35 20.86-13.61 3.52-8.13 1.86-17.59-4.24-24.08L203.66 4.83c-6.03-6.45-17.28-6.45-23.32 0L70.06 122.31c-6.1 6.49-7.75 15.95-4.24 24.08C69.38 154.65 77.59 160 86.69 160h28.89l-78.14 90.91c-5.81 6.78-