(707,1,'2024-03-21 23:43:28','2024-03-21 23:43:28','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n<h2>Landscaping Services</h2>\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Spring Cleanup</a></h3>\r\nRevitalize your garden and outdoor areas with our thorough spring cleaning services. We\'ll prepare your space for a vibrant season.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Full Cleanup</a></h3>\r\nNo matter the time of year, our full cleanup services ensure your property is pristine, functional, and ready for any occasion.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Mulching</a></h3>\r\nProtect and nurture your plants with our mulching services, designed to retain moisture, reduce weed growth, and enhance soil health.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Sod Installation</a></h3>\r\nAchieve a lush, green lawn instantly with our sod installation services. Perfect for new homes or renovating existing lawns.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Fences\r\n</a></h3>\r\nEnhance privacy, security, and aesthetics with our custom fencing solutions, tailored to match your property\'s style and needs.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Lawn Mowing </a></h3>\r\nRegular lawn mowing services to keep your garden looking its best, emphasizing health and precise grooming.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3><a href=\"#\">Tree Service</a></h3>\r\nFrom pruning to removal, our tree services ensure your property\'s safety and enhance its beauty.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repea