(889,1,'2024-03-22 21:48:07','2024-03-22 21:48:07','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Landscaping Services</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Spring Cleanup</h3>		\n		<p>Revitalize your garden and outdoor areas with our thorough spring cleaning services. We\'ll prepare your space for a vibrant season.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Full Cleanup</h3>		\n		<p>No matter the time of year, our full cleanup services ensure your property is pristine, functional, and ready for any occasion.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Mulching</h3>		\n		<p>Protect and nurture your plants with our mulching services, designed to retain moisture, reduce weed growth, and enhance soil health.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Sod Installation</h3>		\n		<p>Achieve a lush, green lawn instantly with our sod installation services. Perfect for new homes or renovating existing lawns.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Fences \n</h3>		\n		<p>Enhance privacy, security, and aesthetics with our custom fencing solutions, tailored to match your property\'s style and needs.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Lawn Mowing </h3>		\n		<p>Regular lawn mowing services to keep your garden looking its best, emphasizing health and precise grooming.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Tree Service</h3>		\n		<p>From pruning to removal, our tree services ensure your property\'s safety and enhance its beauty.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spaci