nificant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n<h3>Spring Cleanup</h3>\r\nRevitalize your garden and outdoor areas with our thorough spring cleaning services. We\'ll prepare your space for a vibrant season.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Full Cleanup</h3>\r\nNo matter the time of year, our full cleanup services ensure your property is pristine, functional, and ready for any occasion.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Mulching</h3>\r\nProtect and nurture your plants with our mulching services, designed to retain moisture, reduce weed growth, and enhance soil health.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Sod Installation</h3>\r\nAchieve a lush, green lawn instantly with our sod installation services. Perfect for new homes or renovating existing lawns.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Fences</h3>\r\nEnhance privacy, security, and aesthetics with our custom fencing solutions, tailored to match your property\'s style and needs.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Lawn Mowing</h3>\r\nRegular lawn mowing services to keep your garden looking its best, emphasizing health and precise grooming.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Tree Service</h3>\r\nFrom pruning to removal, our tree services ensure your property\'s safety and enhance its beauty.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>\r\nStabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Stone Walls</h3>\r\nAdd charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Walkways</h3>\r\nCreate inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Paver Patios</h3>\r\nTransform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Driveways</h3>\r\nFrom classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>\r\n<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\" />\r\n<h3>Concrete</h3>\r\nOur concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\r\nContact Us\r\n</a>','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','69-revision-v1','','','2024-03-22 21:56:37','2024-03-22 21:56:37','',69,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=898',0,'revision','',0),
