ime of year, our full cleanup services ensure your property is pristine, functional, and ready for any occasion.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Mulching</h3>		\n		<p>Protect and nurture your plants with our mulching services, designed to retain moisture, reduce weed growth, and enhance soil health.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Sod Installation</h3>		\n		<p>Achieve a lush, green lawn instantly with our sod installation services. Perfect for new homes or renovating existing lawns.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Fences \n</h3>		\n		<p>Enhance privacy, security, and aesthetics with our custom fencing solutions, tailored to match your property\'s style and needs.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Lawn Mowing </h3>		\n		<p>Regular lawn mowing services to keep your garden looking its best, emphasizing health and precise grooming.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Tree Service</h3>		\n		<p>From pruning to removal, our tree services ensure your property\'s safety and enhance its beauty.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Stone Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','69-revision-v1','','','2024-03-22 22:03:47','2024-03-22 22:03:47','',69,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=903',0,'revision','',0),
(904,1,'2024-03-22 22:05:54','2024-03-22 22:05:54','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-768x1024.jpg 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-225x300.jpg 225w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/IMG-20240317-WA0073.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />													\n		<h2><strong>About Franco\'s Landscaping<br /></strong></h2><p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we pride ourselves on our commitment to excellence and our passion for transforming outdoor spaces into breathtaking landscapes and robust constructions. Located in the heart of Lynn, MA, and serving the entirety of Essex County, our family-operated business has been setting the standard in landscaping and construction services for over a decade. Our team of skilled professionals is dedicated to delivering not just results but an unparalleled customer experience.</p><p>Our philosophy centers on understanding our clients\' visions and turning them into reality. From the initial design to the final touches, we ensure every project reflects our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty. We believe in sustainable practices, using eco-friendly materials and techniques that not only benefit the environment but also enhance the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space.</p><p>Whether you\'re looking to create a serene outdoor retreat, enhance the curb appeal of your property, or under