{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider-separator:before{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-start:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:last-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider-separator:after{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-end:0}.elementor-widget-divider:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text):not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon) .elementor-divider-separator{border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern{--divider-border-style:none}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern.elementor-widget-divider--view-line .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not([class*=elementor-widget-divider--view]) .elementor-divider-separator{width:100%;min-height:var(--divider-pattern-height);-webkit-mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);background-color:var(--divider-color);-webkit-mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url);mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url)}.elementor-widget-divider--no-spacing{--divider-pattern-size:auto}.elementor-widget-divider--bg-round{--divider-pattern-repeat:round}.rtl .elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{direction:rtl}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-divider,.e-con>.elementor-widget-divider{width:var(--container-widget-width,100%);--flex-grow:var(--container-widget-flex-grow)}</style>		\n			<h2>Construction Services</h2>		\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Stone Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n						Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/IMG-20240317-WA0073-qlhx7rv3q276y2xej4bmvhe8brhxdxbtcq61b3i752.jpg\" title=\"IMG-20240317-WA0073\" alt=\"IMG-20240317-WA0073\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		<h2><strong>About Franco\'s Landscaping<br /></strong></h2><p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we pride ourselves on our commitment to excellence and our passion for transforming outdoor spaces into breathtaking landscapes and robust constructions. Located in the heart of Lynn, MA, and serving the entirety of Essex County, our family-operated business has been setting the standard in landscaping and construction services for over a decade. Our team of skilled professionals is dedicated to delivering not just results but an unparalleled customer experience.</p><p>Our philosophy centers on understanding our clients\' visions and turning them into reality. From the initial design to the final touches, we ensure every project reflects our commitment to precision, durability, and beauty. We believe in sustainable practices, using eco-friendly materials and techniques that not only benefit the environment but also enhance the longevity and aesthetic appeal of your outdoor space.</p><p>Whether you\'re looking to create a serene outdoor retreat, enhance the curb appeal of your property, or undertake a significant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.</p>		\n			<h4>Transform your outdoor dreams into stunning reality—start your journey with Franco\'s Landscaping & Construction today by filling out our contact form. Let\'s craft a space where your moments become memories!</h4>		\n		[contact-form-7 id=\"6\" title=\"Contact form 1\"]		\n			<h2>Latest Blog Posts</h2>		\n		[posts-style2 show=\'3\' cat=\'1\' excerptlength=\'24\']','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-03-24 14:45:12','2024-03-24 14:45:12','',10,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=953',0,'revision','',0),
(954,1,'2024-03-24 14:47:10','2024-03-24 14:47:10','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n<h2>Our Recent Projects</h2>\r\n<h2><strong>Landscaping Services:</strong></h2>\r\nOur landscaping services are where creativity meets nature, resulting in breathtaking outdoor spaces that reflect our clients\' dreams. Recent landscaping projects highlight our ability to transform ordinary yards into stunning gardens and living spaces. Whether it\'s a vibrant floral arrangement that captivates the senses or a harmonious water feature that brings tranquility to your garden, Francos Landscaping &amp; Construction is dedicated to creating spaces where life flourishes. Our expertise extends to designing functional and beautiful hardscapes, such as patios and walkways, that complement your home\'s architecture and enhance your outdoor experience. Each project is a collaborative journey with our clients, ensuring that the final landscape is not just beautiful but also a true reflection of their vision and lifestyle.\r\n<h2><strong>Construction Services:</strong></h2>\r\nAt Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we take pride in transforming concepts into concrete reality. Our recent construction projects are a testament to our team\'s expertise and commitment to excellence. From custom-designed decks that provide a serene outdoor retreat to elegant pergolas that enhance backyard aesthetics and functionality, each project is meticulously crafted to meet our clients\' unique needs. Our portfolio showcases diverse constructions, including robust retaining walls that blend seamlessly with the natural landscape and luxurious outdoor kitchens perfect for entertaining. Through precision, craftsmanship, and a keen eye for detail, we bring your vision to life, ensuring that every construction project not only meets but exceeds expectations.\r\n\r\n<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-icon{font-size:var(--divider-icon-size)}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider-separator{display:flex;margin:0;direction:ltr}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:before{display:block;content:\"\";border-block-end:0;flex-grow:1;border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:first-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider-separator:before{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider__element{margin-left:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:last-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right .elementor-divider-separator:after{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-right .elementor-divider__element{margin-right:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:first-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider-separator:before{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-start .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-start:0}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-divider__svg:last-of-type{flex-grow:0;flex-shrink:100}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider-separator:after{content:none}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-end .elementor-divider__element{margin-inline-end:0}.elementor-widget-divider:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text):not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon) .elementor-divider-separator{border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern{--divider-border-style:none}.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern.elementor-widget-divider--view-line .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not(.elementor-widget-divider--view-line) .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--separator-type-pattern:not([class*=elementor-widget-divider--view]) .elementor-divider-separator{width:100%;min-height:var(--divider-pattern-height);-webkit-mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;mask-size:var(--divider-pattern-size) 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);mask-repeat:var(--divider-pattern-repeat);background-color:var(--divider-color);-webkit-mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url);mask-image:var(--divider-pattern-url)}.elementor-widget-divider--no-spacing{--divider-pattern-size:auto}.elementor-widget-divider--bg-round{--divider-pattern-repeat:round}.rtl .elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{direction:rtl}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-divider,.e-con>.elementor-widget-divider{width:var(--container-widget-width,100%);--flex-grow:var(--container-widget-flex-grow)}</style>\r\n\r\n[foogallery id=\"865\"]\r\n<h3>We invite you to take the first step towards transforming your outdoor spaces by reaching out to us today.</h3>\r\n[contact-form-7 id=\"6\" title=\"Contact form 1\"]','Our Projects','','inherit','closed','closed','','676-revision-v1','','','2024-03-24 14:47:10','2024-03-24 14:47:10','',676,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=954',0,'revision','',0),
