eight=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Stone Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n			<h2>Transform your outdoor dreams into stunning reality.</h2>		\n		<p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-3-1-300x206.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"206\" /></p><h3>Start your journey with Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction today by filling out our contact form. Let\'s craft a space where your moments become memories!</h3>[contact-form-7 id=\"6\" title=\"Contact form 1\"]		\n			<h2>Latest Blog Posts</h2>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-07-13 23:23:28','2024-07-13 23:23:28','',10,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=1105',0,'revision','',0),
(1106,1,'2024-07-13 23:33:42','2024-07-13 23:33:42','','Your Dream Outdoors with Passion and Precision!','','inherit','closed','closed','','your-dream-outdoors-with-passion-and-precision','','','2024-07-13 23:33:42','2024-07-13 23:33:42','',676,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Your-Dream-Outdoors-with-Passion-and-Precision.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),
(1107,1,'2024-07-13 23:34:56','2024-07-13 23:34:56','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Our Recent Projects</h2>		\n		<h2><strong>Landscaping Services:</strong></h2><p>Our landscaping services are where creativity meets nature, resulting in breathtaking outdoor spaces that reflect our clients\' dreams. Recent landscaping projects highlight our ability to transform ordinary yards into stunning gardens and living spaces. Whether it\'s a vibrant floral arrangement that captivates the senses or a harmonious water feature that brings tranquility to your garden, Francos Landscaping &amp; Construction is dedicated to creating spaces where life flourishes. Our expertise extends to designing functional and beautiful hardscapes, such as patios and walkways, that complement your home\'s architecture and enhance your outdoor experience. Each project is a collaborative journey with our clients, ensuring that the final landscape is not just beautiful but also a true reflection of their vision and lifestyle.</p><p> </p><h2><strong>Construction Services:</strong></h2><p>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we take pride in transforming concepts into concrete reality. Our recent construction projects are a testament to our team\'s expertise and commitment to excellence. From custom-designed decks that provide a serene outdoor retreat to elegant pergolas that enhance backyard aesthetics and functionality, each project is meticulously crafted to meet our clients\' unique needs. Our portfolio showcases diverse constructions, including robust retaining walls that blend seamlessly with the natural landscape and luxurious outdoor kitchens perfect for entertaining. Through precision, craftsmanship, and a keen eye for detail, we bring your vision to life, ensuring that every construction project not only meets but exceeds expectations.</p><p> </p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-icon{font-size:var(--divider-icon-size)}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider-separator{display:flex;margin:0;direction:ltr}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:before,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator:before{display:block;content:\"\";border-block-end:0;flex-grow:1;border-block-start:var(--divider-border-width) var(--divider-border-style) var(--divider-color)}.elementor-widget-divider--element-align-left .elementor-divider .elementor-divider-separator>.elementor-di