(1115,1,'2024-07-13 23:38:04','2024-07-13 23:38:04','<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Our Recent Projects</h2>		\n		<h2><strong>Landscaping Services:</strong></h2>\n<br>Our landscaping services are where creativity meets nature, resulting in breathtaking outdoor spaces that reflect our clients\' dreams. Recent landscaping projects highlight our ability to transform ordinary yards into stunning gardens and living spaces. Whether it\'s a vibrant floral arrangement that captivates the senses or a harmonious water feature that brings tranquility to your garden, Francos Landscaping &amp; Construction is dedicated to creating spaces where life flourishes. Our expertise extends to designing functional and beautiful hardscapes, such as patios and walkways, that complement your home\'s architecture and enhance your outdoor experience. Each project is a collaborative journey with our clients, ensuring that the final landscape is not just beautiful but also a true reflection of their vision and lifestyle.\n <h2><strong>Construction Services:</strong></h2>\n<br>At Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction, we take pride in transforming concepts into concrete reality. Our recent construction projects are a testament to our team\'s expertise and commitment to excellence. From custom-designed decks that provide a serene outdoor retreat to elegant pergolas that enhance backyard aesthetics and functionality, each project is meticulously crafted to meet our clients\' unique needs. Our portfolio showcases diverse constructions, including robust retaining walls that blend seamlessly with the natural landscape and luxurious outdoor kitchens perfect for entertaining. Through precision, craftsmanship, and a keen eye for detail, we bring your vision to life, ensuring that every construction project not only meets but exceeds expectations.\n 		\n			<h2>Customer Reviews for Franco\'s Landscaping\n</h2>		\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/plugins/elementor-pro/assets/css/widget-carousel.min.css\">		\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png\" alt=\"Sarah Thompson\">\n										<cite>Sarah Thompson</cite>					Read More				\n						Franco\'s Landscaping transformed our backyard into a paradise! Their construction services are top-notch, and their landscaping skills are truly exceptional. Highly recommend!					\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png\" alt=\"Emily Davis\">\n										<cite>Emily Davis</cite>					Read More				\n						Franco\'s Landscaping did an amazing job with our front yard. Their attention to detail in both construction and landscaping services is impressive. Our house has never looked better.					\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png\" alt=\"Michael Johnson\">\n										<cite>Michael Johnson</cite>					Read More				\n						Very pleased with Franco\'s Landscaping. The construction services were efficient and high quality. The landscaping brought our vision to life. Only minor delays, but worth the wait.					\n							<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png\" alt=\"Jessica Lee\">\n										<cite>Jessica Lee</cite>					Read More				\n						Franco\'s Landscaping exceeded our expectations. The team was friendly, and their expertise in both construction and landscaping services made our yard the envy of the neighborhood.					\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>							Previous\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>							Next\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-icon{font-size:var(--divider-icon-size)}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider-separator{display:flex;margin:0;direction:ltr}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator,.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_text .elementor-divider-separator{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-divider--view-line_icon .elementor-divider-separator:after,.elementor-widg