gnificant construction project, Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction is your partner in achieving your vision. Let us show you how we can make your dream outdoor space a reality.</p>		\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h3>Spring Cleanup</h3>		\n		<p>Revitalize your garden and outdoor areas with our thorough spring cleaning services. We\'ll prepare your space for a vibrant season.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Full Cleanup</h3>		\n		<p>No matter the time of year, our full cleanup services ensure your property is pristine, functional, and ready for any occasion.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Mulching</h3>		\n		<p>Protect and nurture your plants with our mulching services, designed to retain moisture, reduce weed growth, and enhance soil health.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Sod Installation</h3>		\n		<p>Achieve a lush, green lawn instantly with our sod installation services. Perfect for new homes or renovating existing lawns.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Fences \n</h3>		\n		<p>Enhance privacy, security, and aesthetics with our custom fencing solutions, tailored to match your property\'s style and needs.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Lawn Mowing </h3>		\n		<p>Regular lawn mowing services to keep your garden looking its best, emphasizing health and precise grooming.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Tree Service</h3>		\n		<p>From pruning to removal, our tree services ensure your property\'s safety and enhance its beauty.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Stone Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon3.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-layout-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>','Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','69-revision-v1','','','2024-07-14 00:32:16','2024-07-14 00:32:16','',69,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=1131',0,'revision','',0),
