		</a>\n							<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240714-WA0030.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"dec12e8\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG-20240714-WA0030\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE2OCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3d3dy5mcmFuY29zbGFuZHNjYXBpbmdjLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMDdcL0lNRy0yMDI0MDcxNC1XQTAwMzAuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZGVjMTJlOCJ9\">\n														</a>\n							<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240714-WA0031.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"dec12e8\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG-20240714-WA0031\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE2OSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3d3dy5mcmFuY29zbGFuZHNjYXBpbmdjLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMDdcL0lNRy0yMDI0MDcxNC1XQTAwMzEuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZGVjMTJlOCJ9\">\n														</a>\n							<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240714-WA0032.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"dec12e8\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG-20240714-WA0032\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE3MCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3d3dy5mcmFuY29zbGFuZHNjYXBpbmdjLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMDdcL0lNRy0yMDI0MDcxNC1XQTAwMzIuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZGVjMTJlOCJ9\">\n														</a>\n							<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240714-WA0033.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"dec12e8\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG-20240714-WA0033\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE3MSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3d3dy5mcmFuY29zbGFuZHNjYXBpbmdjLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMDdcL0lNRy0yMDI0MDcxNC1XQTAwMzMuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZGVjMTJlOCJ9\">\n														</a>\n							<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/IMG-20240714-WA0034.jpg\" data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"dec12e8\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"IMG-20240714-WA0034\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE3MiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL3d3dy5mcmFuY29zbGFuZHNjYXBpbmdjLmNvbVwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNFwvMDdcL0lNRy0yMDI0MDcxNC1XQTAwMzQuanBnIiwic2xpZGVzaG93IjoiZGVjMTJlOCJ9\">\n														</a>\n			<h2>Latest Blog Posts</h2>		\n			<h2>Construction Services</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 26-05-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon1.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Retaining Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Stabilize sloped terrain and add aesthetic value to your property with our custom-designed retaining walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Stone Walls</h3>		\n		<p>Add charm and character to your landscape with our beautifully crafted stone walls.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Walkways</h3>		\n		<p>Create inviting paths through your garden or to your door with our durable and attractive walkway solutions.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Driveways</h3>		\n		<p>From classic concrete to decorative pavers, we design and install driveways that enhance curb appeal and functionality.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Paver Patios</h3>		\n		<p>Transform your outdoor living space with a custom-designed paver patio, perfect for entertaining or relaxing.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"85\" height=\"85\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/featured_icon2.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n			<h3>Concrete</h3>		\n		<p>Our concrete services cater to various needs, including foundations, patios, and decorative elements, combining durability with aesthetics.</p>		\n			<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/contact-us-2/\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n		<p><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-3-1-300x206.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"206\" /></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Start your journey with Franco\'s Landscaping &amp; Construction today by filling out our contact form. Let\'s craft a space where your moments become memories!</h3>		\n			<h2>Transform your outdoor dreams into stunning reality.</h2>		\n		[contact-form-7 id=\"6\" title=\"Contact form 1\"]		\n			<h2>Transform your outdoor dreams into stunning reality.</h2>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2024-07-15 23:07:26','2024-07-15 23:07:26','',10,'https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/?p=1187',0,'revision','',0),
