(1,'custom',NULL,NULL,NULL,'','Sarah Thompson','','https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png','Franco\'s Landscaping transformed our backyard into a paradise! Their construction services are top-notch, and their landscaping skills are truly exceptional. Highly recommend!','2024-07-06 23:00:00',5,1,'positive',NULL,'2024-07-16 10:38:15','2024-07-16 10:38:15'),
(2,'custom','','','','','Emily Davis','','https://www.francoslandscapingc.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Untitled-design-1-1.png','Franco\'s Landscaping did an amazing job with our front yard. Their attention to detail in both construction and landscaping services is impressive. Our house has never looked better.','2024-07-06 23:00:00',5,1,'positive','\"\"','2024-07-16 10:38:20','2024-07-16 10:38:50');
